%I A154640 #12 Nov 16 2026 23:08:48
%S A154640 5,5,20,60,210,690,2340,7830,26370,88560,297810,1000890,3364740,
%T A154640 11310030,38018970,127798560,429592410,1444059090,4854163140,
%U A154640 16317112230,54849471570,184374772560,619770059010,2083337665290,7003074537540,23540616254430,79131046384170,265996540690560
%N A154640 a(n) is the number of spheres that are added in the n-th generation of Apollonian packing of three-dimensional spheres, starting with five mutually tangent spheres and using "strategy (a)" to count them (see the reference).
%C A154640 In strategy (a) we do not count spheres that are generated (by reflection) from quintuples that were not generated in the previous generation.
%H A154640 James Guillochon, <a href="/A154640/b154640.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 0..1000</a>
%H A154640 James Guillochon, <a href="https://github.com/guillochon/oeis-results/tree/main/A154640">Mallows's 3D Apollonian packing: proofs, corrections and programs for A154639-A154645</a>
%H A154640 James Guillochon, <a href="https://guillochon.github.io/apollonian-spheres/">Apollonian Sphere Generations</a> (three.js viewer of the packing through generation 12, both strategies)
%H A154640 C. L. Mallows, <a href="https://cs.uwaterloo.ca/journals/JIS/VOL12/Mallows/mallows8.html">Growing Apollonian Packings</a>, J. Integer Sequences, 12 (2009), article 09.2.1.
%F A154640 From _James Guillochon_, Nov 12 2026: (Start)
%F A154640 G.f.: 5*(1-x)*(1-x-3*x^2)/(1-3*x-3*x^2+6*x^3) = 5*G(x)/H(x), where G(x) and H(x) are the g.f.s of A154638 and A162740,
%F A154640 a(n) = 3*a(n-1) + 3*a(n-2) - 6*a(n-3) for n >= 4. (End)
%e A154640 For a(3), we apply reflection only to the 20 quintuples that were generated in the second generation, ignoring the 10 "extra" quintuples (which will appear as ABA = BAB in the third generation).
%o A154640 (PARI) a(n) = polcoef(5*(1-x)*(1-x-3*x^2)/(1-3*x-3*x^2+6*x^3) + O(x^(n+1)), n); \\ _James Guillochon_, Nov 12 2026
%Y A154640 For other sequences relating to the 3-dimensional case, see A154638-A154645.
%K A154640 easy,nonn,changed
%O A154640 0,1
%A A154640 _Colin Mallows_, Jan 13 2009
%E A154640 a(7)-a(27) from _James Guillochon_, Nov 12 2026
